  [Node 1     ] DECIDED H(BLOCK_42)
  [Node 2     ] DECIDED H(BLOCK_42)

--- Final decisions ---
Node 0 (honest)   : H(BLOCK_42)
Node 1 (honest)   : H(BLOCK_42)
